moto/B4121P1115-flash.bin
    Boot flash of a Motorola VP Oncore, model B4121P1115, software P/N
    98-P36830P, VER 8, REV 8, 06 Aug 1996.  Read over BDM from the
    receiver in an HP 58503A.  Copyright 1991-1996 Motorola, Inc.

moto/B1121P1114-flash.bin
    Boot flash of a Motorola Oncore 6-channel receiver, model B1121P1114,
    software P/N 98-P39972M, VER 8, REV 4, 13 Jul 1995 (serial
    SSG0163878, from an HP Z3805A).  Read over the host port through the
    firmware's factory loader (tools/loader).  Copyright 1991-1995
    Motorola, Inc.

moto/decompiled/B4121P1115.c
    Ghidra decompiler output for moto/B4121P1115-flash.bin, with names and
    types from tools/ghidra.  Derived from the vendor image; regenerate
    with tools/ghidra (OncoreExportC.java).

